    "title": "Top 10 biggest Sarasota area events taking place this October",
    "text": "EVENTS\nTop 10 biggest Sarasota area events taking place this October\nA month's worth of events at a park, fall festivals, Oktoberfest and Halloween celebrations, and more things to do in the Sarasota area in October.\nJimmy Geurts\nSarasota Herald-Tribune\nSept. 27, 2026, 5:03 a.m. ET\nWith September nearly over, and Sarasota's off-season along with it, the local events calendar will rapidly start ramping up in October.\nMultiple Oktoberfest and Halloween celebrations will take place locally, along with festivals celebrating the fall season (well, as close as we get to it in Florida).",
